&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive VIP Relationship Manager to join our Australian Strategic Markets team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a VIP Relationship Manager, you will play a key role in expanding our base of VIP clients in Australia. This role is focused on high net worth individuals, family offices and smaller corporate clients, driving our growth through partnerships and key client development in parallel to our institutional team, which on the other hand focuses on larger professional, enterprise and institutional clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5e234547 _2c148f22&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary goal: maximize revenue in the region through onboarding and retention of VIP clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate an AUM strategy and revenue optimization based on the product offering of OKX in Australia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the local executive leadership team to contribute to the overall strategic direction of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our partnership work in Australia through identifying the right partners to work with plus executing any partnership negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with high net worth individuals and key clients in Australia ensuring positive customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long lasting client relationships to obtain referrals and new sales channels - origination of new prospective clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive account management, work with operations to inform clients of potential roadblocks - frozen accounts, EDD etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a brand ambassador, ensuring customers are fully aware of the OKX value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZvAmdvgIGoKyiHxjBTiu68Kcs9d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
