&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business or a related field (or equivalent years of experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Mandarin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in VIP business development within the crypto, private banking, finance or trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to interpret market data to drive strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and negotiation abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goal-oriented mindset, with a focus on achieving and exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
