&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZnTduk4RoRHT2xOzYplF8sigff&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Track performance and continuously optimize: define KPIs, monitor results, gather market feedback, and refine programs based on data and learnings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
