&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SPxkd4nTjoYMXUxdEcouDVTGsuh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NqI8dIe4noRyepxuky5usKYSsMe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZOXd1qk6or9H8xOiGouBL10sbf&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YVWBdFTauo9yMuxbrduuJRUMsjo&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEJhdcY7loNBknxhEAEuFVwcsxm&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T424dUgeQoZq4cxevjAuBaxBsSb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FFLidDdsbo0jBmxLNmKuAA9asNe&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WYpjdMdRNoC8E1x9f2ruCfApsrc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gkm1dHIWkoUQdjxTkILuLxavsZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HyzZdbLE2otna2xfC22uPUMLsYe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HyzZdbLE2otna2xfC22uPUMLsYe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HN4ddcpefoYFucxAX0mlQK2lgvf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HN4ddcpefoYFucxAX0mlQK2lgvf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HN4ddcpefoYFucxAX0mlQK2lgvf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;TZf5df1bsoACUOxxVnflRGgNgzb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OInMdRrpPo5CDQx0XK3lvbrigKg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OInMdRrpPo5CDQx0XK3lvbrigKg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Omcvd5E8SoBZTVxL8iZl8z35gLf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PSzYdqW1ao2cplxMXutlrTFYg2q&quot;&gt;负责高价值客户的开发与维护，深入了解各家产品与解决方案，通过专业够听和定制化的解决方案，推动交易、资产及收入等关键指标的持续增长。该岗位高度 KPI 导向，需要强目标感、快速学习能力，同时能接受高强度出差。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PSzYdqW1ao2cplxMXutlrTFYg2q&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Omcvd5E8SoBZTVxL8iZl8z35gLf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFe5d3DS0oFTwVxfnZKlSulFghh&quot;&gt;Responsible for acquiring and managing high-value clients, developing a deep understanding of different products and solutions across platforms, and driving sustainable growth in trading volume, assets and revenue through professional consultation and customized solutions. This is a highly KPI-driven role that requires strong goal orientation, fast learning ability, and the ability to handle frequent business travel.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFe5d3DS0oFTwVxfnZKlSulFghh&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;开发与拓展&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;通过多渠道（线下拜访、行业会议、社群、转介绍等）挖掘并开发潜在高价值客户（包括但不限于专业交易者、家族办公室等）。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;能够快速画像并识别高潜力目标客户，建立并维护客户线索池和跟进节奏。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;3&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;客户关系管理与业绩达成&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;建立并维护稳固的客户关系，定期Review，了解用户交易需求、资金规模与产品需求。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;对所负责客户的&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;资产规模、交易量、收益贡献等关键指标（KPI）负责&lt;/strong&gt;，按月度/季度完成业绩目标。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;7&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;产品与解决方案咨询&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;深入理解各家主流交易平台的各产品条线（如：现货、合约、期权、Earn/理财、结构化产品等），能够为客户提供对比分析和专业建议。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;收集客户需求与痛点，协同产品、运营等团队，为重点客户提供定制化解决方案。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;11&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;行业洞察与学习&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;持续跟进行业动态、竞品策略和新产品形态，快速掌握并消化新知识，形成对客户有价值的观点与建议。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;定期输出客户/市场反馈与竞品情报，为内部策略和产品迭代提供一线视角。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;14&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;15&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Acquisition &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Identify and acquire potential high-value clients (including but not limited to professional traders, family offices, etc.) through multiple channels such as in-person visits, industry events, communities and referrals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Quickly profile and identify high-potential target clients, maintain a structured lead pipeline and follow-up rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;18&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Relationship Management &amp;amp; Target Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong, long-term relationships with clients; conduct regular reviews to understand their trading needs, capital scale and product preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Take full responsibility for key KPIs of your client portfolio, including asset under management, trading volume and revenue contribution, and achieve monthly/quarterly performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;21&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Solutions Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Develop an in-depth understanding of major product lines on leading trading platforms (e.g. spot, perpetuals, options, Earn/wealth management, structured products, etc.) and provide professional comparison and recommendations to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Gather client needs and pain points, and work with product, operations and other internal teams to deliver customized solutions for key clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;24&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Insight &amp;amp; Continuous Learning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Continuously track industry trends, competitor strategies and new product types; quickly absorb new knowledge and translate it into valuable insights and suggestions for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Regularly share client/market feedback and competitive intelligence to provide frontline input for internal strategy and product iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HN4ddcpefoYFucxAX0mlQK2lgvf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HN4ddcpefoYFucxAX0mlQK2lgvf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HN4ddcpefoYFucxAX0mlQK2lgvf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;TZf5df1bsoACUOxxVnflRGgNgzb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Omcvd5E8SoBZTVxL8iZl8z35gLf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;至少&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;2 年及以上 web3 行业工作经验&lt;/strong&gt;，对主流交易所、钱包、托管、DeFi 等产品有实际使用或服务经验。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;能够&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;快速识别与筛选目标客户&lt;/strong&gt;，具备优秀的沟通谈判技巧与关系维护能力，有高潜力客户的客户关系管对金融市场、衍生品、风险收益等有基本认知，有银行、券商、资管等金融背景者优先。客户服务和运营等相关工作经验优先；&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;明确的&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;KPI &amp;amp; 结果导向&lt;/strong&gt;，习惯用数据衡量业绩。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;能接受&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;高强度工作节奏与频繁出差 / 拜访&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;自驱力强，抗压能力好，能够在不确定环境中找到路径并推动落地。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;能够&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;中英文双语工作（听说读写）；&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;本科及以上学历，&lt;strong&gt;金融、经济、会计、数学、统计、计算机等相关专业优先&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;7&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;At least&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;2 years of work experience in the Web3 industry&lt;/strong&gt;, with hands-on usage or service experience related to major exchanges, wallets, custody solutions, DeFi products, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Able to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;quickly identify and qualify target clients&lt;/strong&gt;, with strong communication, negotiation and relationship-building skills. Experience in managing high-potential client relationships, client service or account operations is preferred. Basic understanding of financial markets, derivatives and risk–return; background in banking, securities or asset management is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Clear&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;KPI &amp;amp; result orientation&lt;/strong&gt;, and comfortable using data to measure and manage performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Comfortable with a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;high-intensity work pace and frequent travel / client visits&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;temp-li bullet1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet1&quot;&gt;Strong self-motivation and resilience, able to find paths forward and drive execution in an uncertain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
